flowchart TD
    A[State intent: one feature, clearly scoped] --> B[RED: failing test on REAL data]
    B --> C[Agent runs it — confirm it FAILS]
    C --> D[GREEN: minimal implementation]
    D --> E[Agent runs it — confirm it PASSES]
    E --> F{Verify independently}
    F -->|Real artifact? Honest claims? Minimal diff?| G[Commit: RED, then GREEN]
    F -->|Something off| B
    G --> H[CI green: fmt · clippy · test · coverage · fuzz · deny]
    H --> A
